# L4-7 (docs/plans/l4-upgrade.md) — il resoconto popola il MONDO DI CHI PARLA:
# impegno diverso da una lezione, riscontro con la deissi di persona, stato che
# finisce (strato ended) e torna, e un lettore («What do I have?»).

!set PARROT0_SESSION=
!set PARROT0_LANG=en
!reset
[test il mondo di chi parla: resoconto, fine dello stato, lettore]
!timeout 4
> What do I have?
<~ You haven't told me about anything of yours yet.
> The RCD in my house keeps tripping.
<~ I see: the RCD in your house keeps tripping.
> My espresso tastes bitter.
<~ I see: your espresso tastes bitter.
> Espresso is a coffee.
<~ Learned
> Our kettle makes a noise.
> What do I have?
<~ the residual current device in your house keeps tripping
> My espresso is not bitter anymore.
<~ I see: your espresso is not bitter anymore.
> Does my espresso taste bitter?
<~ Not anymore: you told me that changed.
> What do I have?
<! espresso
> My espresso tastes bitter again.
> Does my espresso taste bitter?
<~ Yes
!reset
